INSERT INTO `quest_offer_reward` (`ID`, `Emote1`, `Emote2`, `Emote3`, `Emote4`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `EmoteDelay4`, `RewardText`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
(40162, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'They had it coming for stealing all of my stuff and being so mean to me! Thanks for getting some of them back, it means a lot, here, for the hard work, one for you!', 0),
(40176, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '<Eudokia looks toward the materials curiously.>$B$BThis should do, I will begin to prepare the spell now.', 0),
(40177, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '<The Goblin takes the device and quickly inspect it.>$B$BYeah, this is it. Here, take your cash. Now scram, I gotta make sure this baby ain\'t broken!', 0),
(40188, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Oh, Yeggle sent you? Heh, that guys a character he is, thankfully to hear he made it, some of those other gutter-rats were given a lucky way out of this world compared to what I dreamed of.', 0),
(40189, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Hey, this might be it, I swear if theres a single crack on here, you\'re gonna go and have to get another one, understand? Hmm... Seems spotless, good, this shall do just fine, now the final step!', 0),
(40190, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Now, we can unlock true riches!', 0),
(40191, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'This is my charm, but, something doesn\'t seem right about it, too much time within the hands of a ghost may have, cursed it!', 0),
(40194, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'This Mojo doesn\'t look normal, it is dark, and thick, swirling with the seeds of evil deep within it. The Hazzuri tribe did the same long ago, and abandoned this past for a new fate. Now, they sent speakers and emmisaries to Zul\'Razar in hopes to bring the Razzari into the fold.$B$BI had thought our leaders better then to listen to the words of madmen, to buy wares from the peddlers of evil misdeeds.', 0),
(40195, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'So, it is done then, you have braved Zul\'Razar, and killed the leaders. The skulls will be a reminder to any who betray what we really are. I hold hope that my people can see reason, and deep down will know this had to be done for the best.$B$BI must still find a way to reverse this Tainted Mojo, but until then, I thank you, your efforts have surely helped my people. Without you, who knows what would have happened to this island.', 0),
(40196, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'It is done, you have gotten revenge for each and every one of us. I cannot thank you enough for smiting him down, if only the fates had been different, if only he acted with honor and kept his word, perhaps we would be back home.$B$BIt is not something to dwell on, but we Kalkor will find our place in the world. You have earned esteem within our community, and restored our spirits, I wish you the best in your future.', 0),
(40199, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'So, you actually are stronger then I first thought. So many big ogre think they are tough just because they think they are and then they get smashed. You are tough, and strong, and you prove it, maybe you are a real ogre. War must continue, it is the only way we can go forward.', 0),
(40200, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'So, you actually are stronger then I first thought. So many big ogres think they are tough just because they think they are and then they get smashed. You are tough, and strong, and you prove it, maybe you are a real orc. We must continue, it is the only way we can go forward.', 0),
(40217, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Blatarg was looking for me huh? I\'m doing fine, I just have new company, but they\'ve learned well enough to leave me alone. Perhaps you can be of assistance, I got some stuff I need worked out!', 0),
(40218, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'We meet again Glasseye, this is the eye that stared back at me in my dreams, and now I hold it within my fingers. I sense that I may be able to make great strides with this, and I thank you greatly. No longer will my dreams be haunted, you\'ve done me a great service.', 0),
(40219, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Those stupid pirates thought that they were so smart taking over that mine, now look at them, DEAD! Puny $R has done good for me, and I reward good work, here, take this, you\'re now an official mercenary for Maul\'ogg!', 0),
(40258, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '<A grin would spread from ear to ear across Emberguts face> So long it has been gone, and here it is!$B$BYou\'ve done well, I never thought I would see it again and it is in my hands. Maybe now Embergut can be the strongest ogre!', 0),
(40264, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'I see. Lord Cruk\'Zogg will bring us into ruin, I must come up with a new way to convince him.', 0),
(40265, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'I see a great future in you, you have done well, now, let us begin.', 0),
(40266, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'A bold plan he has come up with, I would not have suspected Bol\'ukk to speak such words. But perhaps there is no other option, I will begin to work on an elixir.', 0),
(40267, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'So, Haz\'gorg sent you. It\'s been some time, now, tell me what he desires from me, cause no doubt he needed something!', 0),
(40268, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '<The troll looks almost filled with glee> You have done well, this wretch had much worse coming to him, but this shall do, especially given my current state. I will do as asked, and assist Haz\'gorg.', 0),
(40269, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '<Insom\'ni would inspect the Ligment curiously, and nod his head>. This shall do just fine.', 0),
(40270, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '<Insom\'ni would inspect the Ligment curiously, and nod his head>. This shall do just fine. This shall do just fine.', 0),
(40272, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '<Haz\'gorg would let out a great sigh of relief> What has been done here today cannot be celebrated with great enthusiasm, we have done but a small evil for the good of the Maul\'ogg. Unknowingly, my kind will be thankful for your efforts, even if they do not know anything has transpired. I ask of you to keep your silence, and for your assistance, I offer you a gift from my kind.', 0),
(40275, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'We are one step closer to uncovering the secrets of this place, but I feel there is moe to be done in order to secure ourselves here.', 0),
(40276, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'It is done then, with their leaders killed the Naga will be uncoherent, and nothing more then a disorganized mass. Even the largest army will always lose to one more disciplined, and focused. We have truly weakened their position this day, and perhaps forever.', 0);
INSERT INTO `quest_request_items` (`ID`, `EmoteOnComplete`, `EmoteOnIncomplete`, `CompletionText`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
(40162, 0, 0, 'Any luck with getting back my Shell Necklace\'s?', 0),
(40176, 0, 0, 'These materials will be the only thing to help Jang\'zo. If I am correct, the dark magic could be influencing the trolls of the Razzari and driving them further into madness.', 0),
(40177, 0, 0, 'Look buddy, the longer we sit around here and talk, the higher the probability that thing is getting chewed up!', 0),
(40188, 0, 0, 'What, you haven\'t seen a goblin before?', 0),
(40189, 0, 0, 'Look pal, I can	 just tell you what I got planned or else you\'ll steal my idea! Now find that Shell!', 0),
(40190, 0, 0, 'The Gold Bar is the last ingredient for this recipe, hurry up, and get one pal!', 0),
(40191, 0, 0, 'The Silver Strand can be a dangerous place now. Be careful when you go find my charm.', 0),
(40194, 0, 0, 'There be no time to waste! Each second that we remain idle and speak with one another, is another second that their minds rot away to this foreign evil.', 0),
(40195, 0, 0, 'Chief Imaz\'ul is a coward for what he has done, the chief of our tribe is to hold strong, even in the face of tempting offers.', 0),
(40196, 0, 0, 'Have you had any success in finding Lykourgos?', 0),
(40199, 0, 0, 'What, you too weak to kill panthers and creepers? Do I need to send someone else?', 0),
(40200, 0, 0, 'Have you found Tanglemoss? It may require more then just yourself for this to be done.', 0),
(40217, 0, 0, 'Yes, you need something, or just here to talk?', 0),
(40218, 0, 0, 'Glasseye may have strong, magical powers, be sure to keep your wits about you.', 0),
(40219, 0, 0, 'While you\'re talking, who knows what\'s happening to my emerald, go get it!', 0),
(40258, 0, 0, 'Have you found the orb?', 0),
(40264, 0, 0, 'So, have you spoken with him?', 0),
(40265, 0, 0, 'Have you had the opportunity to collect what it is I asked?', 0),
(40266, 0, 0, 'Have you spoken with Seer Bol\'ukk?', 0),
(40267, 0, 0, 'Yes?', 0),
(40268, 0, 0, 'Have you found that blackhearted mongrel yet?', 0),
(40269, 0, 0, 'Why are you here, you should be searching for a Ligment.', 0),
(40270, 0, 0, 'Have you ventured within the Sunken Temple?', 0),
(40271, 0, 0, 'I see.. Then let us finish what we have set out to do.', 0),
(40272, 0, 0, 'Is it done?', 0),
(40275, 0, 0, 'Have you dealt with the Naga?', 0),
(40276, 0, 0, 'Have you had any progress with the Naga?', 0);
